{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1793.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"96ae889682d8de78c4d2a7dc6d19061f0b808d7aadc2b9067fbbf88cf3f684d8","ja":"うわ～！　どれも美味しそう！\nねえねえ、みんなは何食べる？","zh":"哇～！每一样看起来都好好吃！\n对了对了，大家要吃什么？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1793.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"d7636006a9a0a3b2d10001d21606223be78df289c823b3df9f13dcad0a50476e","ja":"ショートケーキとチーズケーキに……\nマロングラッセも！　あとはどうしようかな～♪","zh":"草莓蛋糕和芝士蛋糕……\n糖渍栗子也要！接下来该怎么办呢～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1793.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"ae9dc008b774b9bb942a386eee20a2b0f869340f8d9d01d7dbdad648200cadd0","ja":"可奈、いっぺんに盛りすぎ。\n食べきれなくなったら困るでしょ？","zh":"可奈，一下子盛太多了。\n吃不完的话会很困扰吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1793.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"f2ad46eff1251b12b0fa64511969524083f09499af988e5f83cc009553798ece","ja":"え～、これくらい、大丈夫だよ～。\nあっ、シフォンケーキもある、とっちゃお♪","zh":"呃～，这点小事，没问题啦～。\n啊，还有戚风蛋糕，拿一块吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1793.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"1160761e113f1d7677d0e7cbb1a226d2e66abcfecdabee07633f3d3c1087e765","ja":"（あら、軽食もありますのね。\nしょっぱいものも一緒に楽しめるのはお得ですわ）","zh":"（哎呀，还有小吃呢。能和咸味食品一起享用，真是赚到了）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1793.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"8046fd85cb81edf0c7892812b7681f7c9282f3bf392c14578080e0b8ed1cc0a9","ja":"（でも、やはりここはケーキバイキングらしく、\n甘いものをたくさん食べるべきなのかしら……）","zh":"（不过，既然是蛋糕自助餐，果然还是应该多吃点甜食吧……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1793.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"9443580e29759148762823191be374e8102aa7b1ae3225c7cc80068795ef1ad1","ja":"千鶴お嬢さん、ずいぶん悩んでるみたいだねぇ。\nお口に合うか、心配なのかい？","zh":"千鹤小姐，看来你很烦恼呢。  \n是担心不合你的口味吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1793.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"2c0e9f8f49ad3896d5f78b6744b400879d0dfef9fa98f0629ddaff4835a32603","ja":"千鶴ちゃんのおうちで出てくるものに比べたら、\n物足りないかもしれないけど、どれも美味しそうよ。","zh":"和千鹤家里拿出来的东西相比，可能会觉得不够丰盛，但每一样看起来都很好吃。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1793.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"4423c51bcb8fbaa5107b85535454403e8497fb4b7128827773e2f12f9f9c87e4","ja":"あ、あら、そうですのね！\nええ、そういうことなら、いただいてみますわ！","zh":"啊、哎呀，原来是这样呀！\n嗯，既然如此，那我就尝尝看吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1793.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"f57cfdaa3423982ac99cb2c739d50536ade8181714dd218d7b7e16d5029bb1e3","ja":"10分後……","zh":"10分钟后……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1793.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"12b5c708624ebdca4cdff43756a9cfb7b0f4c15fe5702afa418a463f19717008","ja":"それぞれ好きに取ってきたら、\nとてもたくさんの量になってしまいましたわね……。","zh":"各自随意取来后，不知不觉竟然变得这么多了呢……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1793.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"73c8e730fe2772a6541514f2ef0ef42c7e92fde5c3f6c7a2d49af2f61cd48d21","ja":"つい、とりすぎてしまったべさ。","zh":"一不小心就拿多了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1793.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"2313e4a2d1e49d5c166b849722e850b5855d508101c7a4462665f64b0301c9ab","ja":"これくらい、みんなとおしゃべりしながらなら、\nきっとあっという間よ。さ、いただきましょ♪","zh":"这么点分量，要是和大家边聊天边吃的话，肯定一眨眼就吃完了。来，开动吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1793.unity3d","item_key":"commands[45].text","source_sha256":"e863b1db2f547ef55e2b2ee1b686c0f8167019079867db5f6d9d1bde128a57b7","ja":"みんなの話題は、自然にBOTのことになって……","zh":"大家的话题自然而然地变成了BOT……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1793.unity3d","item_key":"commands[46].text","source_sha256":"e9e30f2606d116f3f54e2887d7818bb3e8192e350fe103c28d44c660d701de1f","ja":"……でも、まだやりたかった対決って、\nたくさんあるよね！　生クリーム飲み対決とか！","zh":"……不过，想进行的对决还有很多吧！比如喝鲜奶油对决之类的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1793.unity3d","item_key":"commands[47].text","source_sha256":"55b35f78db4b723d6a2d5b379078420930ef5048d82e72f8fcac4efd39ee3608","ja":"あっ！　それなら今ここでやっちゃう？\n生クリームたっぷりのケーキがあるし！","zh":"啊！那要不要现在就在这里做了？正好还有满满鲜奶油的蛋糕呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1793.unity3d","item_key":"commands[48].text","source_sha256":"d46ebee9eb6ba1821506eac566881e47d33d1e9fb94ac7a9c6994ed054cc63d1","ja":"だめよ。\nお店や他のお客さんの迷惑になっちゃうでしょ。","zh":"不行哦。会给店里和其他客人添麻烦的。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1793.unity3d","item_key":"commands[49].text","source_sha256":"8b806bc4a9a2579c61cca1aacc31b4cdb0339263b5f792dcdbc622ec7784d122","ja":"えー！　すごく面白そうなのに～！","zh":"诶——！明明看起来超级有意思的呀～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1793.unity3d","item_key":"commands[50].text","source_sha256":"eb7af14a6875cf7d6624a063aa55d107af648c51a123b0aeebc791a9a8da3692","ja":"でも、あんまり騒ぐと迷惑だよね……。\nう～ん……。","zh":"不过，闹得太厉害会给别人添麻烦吧……。\n嗯……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
